{"id":9566424957096,"title":"Bracken Hot \u0026 Cold Back Wrap","handle":"hot-cold-back-wrap","description":"\u003cp\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eHeat or ice, strapped right where you need it.\u003c\/strong\u003e The Bracken Hot \u0026amp; Cold Back Wrap covers your whole lower and mid back and stays put with two elastic straps — so you can move around the house instead of lying on an ice pack.\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003ch3\u003eWhy it's better than a gel pack\u003c\/h3\u003e\n\u003cul\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\n\u003cstrong\u003eHot or cold\u003c\/strong\u003e — microwave 2 minutes for warmth, or freeze for cold (slushy in about 1 hour, fully frozen in 2–4)\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\n\u003cstrong\u003eNo leaking gel\u003c\/strong\u003e — a grid of sealed cells filled with polymer beads spreads temperature evenly and flexes to fit your body\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\n\u003cstrong\u003eLarge coverage\u003c\/strong\u003e — about 23 × 14 in (58 × 35 cm) with two adjustable elastic straps (~31 in each)\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\n\u003cstrong\u003eReusable\u003c\/strong\u003e — just re-soak it when it dries out and it's good as new\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003c\/ul\u003e\n\u003ch3\u003eFirst-time setup (3 minutes)\u003c\/h3\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eYour wrap ships dry and flat to keep shipping free. Before first use, soak it in water for about 3 minutes until the cells fill up, then heat or freeze. If it ever dries out, soak it again for 30+ minutes.\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003ch3\u003eWhat's in the box\u003c\/h3\u003e\n\u003cul\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e1 × Hot \u0026amp; Cold Back Wrap\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e2 × Elastic straps\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e1 × Instruction card\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003c\/ul\u003e\n\u003ch3\u003eRisk-free\u003c\/h3\u003e\n\u003cul\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\u003cstrong\u003e60-day money-back guarantee\u003c\/strong\u003e\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\n\u003cstrong\u003eFree tracked shipping\u003c\/strong\u003e on every order\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003c\/ul\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e\u003cem\u003eAlways test the temperature before applying, and use a thin cloth between the wrap and your skin. Limit sessions to 20 minutes.\u003c\/em\u003e\u003c\/p\u003e","published_at":"2026-08-15T00:09:52-04:00","created_at":"2026-08-13T03:25:35-04:00","vendor":"Bracken","type":"Hot \u0026 Cold Wrap","tags":[],"price":2999,"price_min":2999,"price_max":2999,"available":true,"price_varies":false,"compare_at_price":0,"compare_at_price_min":0,"compare_at_price_max":0,"compare_at_price_varies":false,"variants":[{"id":55867231928488,"title":"Back Wrap","option1":"Back Wrap","option2":null,"option3":null,"sku":"1b3fb9e4-eb3c-4b87-a80d-9b7d651cc196","requires_shipping":true,"taxable":true,"featured_image":{"id":52538428031144,"product_id":9566424957096,"position":8,"created_at":"2026-08-13T03:25:43-04:00","updated_at":"2026-08-13T03:25:44-04:00","alt":"Large Hot \u0026 Ice Compress Self-Absorbing Water Shawl Pad Reusable Polymer Resin Ice Pack for Back Knee Neck Shoulder Ankle Sprain","width":1000,"height":1000,"src":"https:\/\/cdn.shopify.com\/s\/files\/1\/0762\/6283\/4344\/files\/Sb68eddcb4ffe47daa5a0a75aa94bc942Q.webp?v=1786605944","variant_ids":[55867231928488]},"available":true,"name":"Bracken Hot \u0026 Cold Back Wrap - Back Wrap","public_title":"Back Wrap","options":["Back Wrap"],"price":2999,"weight":140,"compare_at_price":0,"inventory_management":"shopify","barcode":"7445028817828","featured_media":{"alt":"Large Hot \u0026 Ice Compress Self-Absorbing Water Shawl Pad Reusable Polymer Resin Ice Pack for Back Knee Neck Shoulder Ankle Sprain","id":41193928196264,"position":8,"preview_image":{"aspect_ratio":1.0,"height":1000,"width":1000,"src":"https:\/\/cdn.shopify.com\/s\/files\/1\/0762\/6283\/4344\/files\/Sb68eddcb4ffe47daa5a0a75aa94bc942Q.webp?v=1786605944"}},"quantity_rule":{"min":1,"max":null,"increment":1},"quantity_price_breaks":[],"requires_selling_plan":false,"selling_plan_allocations":[]}],"images":["\/\/cdn.shopify.com\/s\/files\/1\